    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4396</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2201</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それにしても、軍の基地に
あっさり忍びこむなんて
&lt;Ines&gt;って一体何者なの？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You managed to infiltrate a
military base so easily...
Just who are you, &lt;Ines&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Official: Ines' Secret</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4616</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2202</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>さぁ？
女には、いろいろ
ヒ・ミ・ツがあるのよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>“Who” indeed?
Every lady is entitled to
her own little secrets.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>4916</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2203</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Shing&gt;が、私の
『特別な人』になってくれるなら
ぜ〜んぶ教えてあげるんだけど？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But y’know, if you were my
“special someone,” then
maaaybe I could tell you?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5128</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2204</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こ、困るよ……オレには
&lt;Kohaku&gt;という人が……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>U-Uh, gosh... 
But my heart already
belongs to &lt;Kohaku&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5532</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2205</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おいおい……
軽くあしらわれすぎだろ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey now, you really
caving in that easy?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>5604</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2206</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あら、&lt;Hisui&gt;でもいいわよ？
年下……嫌いじゃないから∀</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh? Then how about you, &lt;Hisui&gt;?
I don't mind a little age gap, you know. ∀</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>6024</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>C2207</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>えッ∀
……遠慮しとく。
俺は、そんなに軽い男じゃねぇぜ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>H-Huh? ∀
Um, nah... I ain't that shallow a guy...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
